{"slug":"UPD-Demonology-NO-KEY-ESP-ALL-GHOST-INFO-FULLBRIGHT-HUNT-ESCAPE-211605","_id":"69f7a388091211203028e0d4","title":"ALL FEATURES, ESP, HELPER AND MORE","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77f27","gameId":18199615050,"name":"[UPD] Demonology🕯️","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-2651cff28f8766658687d6df2067bf03-cc2e7a2ee017.png","placeId":18199615050},"features":"🟢 [WORKING] 🟢\nkeyless btw\n\nℹ️ GUI HIDE/SHOW KEY ℹ️\n- PC: F1 Key\n- Mobile: Toggle Button (Upper Right Corner)\n\n🔵 CHANGELOGS 🔵\n➥ Reworked on Everything for The New Game Update\n➥ Fixed Stat Watchers (EMF Level & Broken Glasses)\n➥ Fixed Toggle GUI Issues\n➥ Added Items ESP\n\n🟡 UPCOMING UPDATE DROPS 🟡\n➥ Players ESP\n➥ Items ESP\n➥ Auto Capture Ghost Photo\n\n---// Features\\\\---\n\n- Ghost ESP\n- Fullbright\n- Orb ESP\n- Handprints ESP\n- Items ESP\n- Photo Reward Objects ESP\n- Infinite Stamina\n- Hunt Escape\n\n---// Stats & Ghost Info \\\\---\n\n- Current Room\n- Favorite Room\n- Age\n- Gender\n- Hunting?\n- Ghost Orbs?\n- Handprints?\n- EMF Level 5? (✅ Fixed)\n- Ghost Footsteps?\n- Broken Glass? (✅ Fixed)\n- Entity Smoke?\n- Nightmare Shatter? (✅ Fixed)\n- Ghost Speed\n- Player Speed\n- Current Room Temperature\n- Favorite Room Temperature\n\n❗ NOTE ❗\n\nThis script is made to be a Custom Mode Helper. If you are looking for an Auto Guesser which will do your job in regular modes (Easy-Medium-Hard-Nightmare), this is not the right place. But don't worry! This script will also help you in those modes.\n\n❗ SOME INFORMATION ❗\n\nIf you hear a glass break noise and the 'Broken Glass' value is still \"No\" or 'Nightmare Shatter' shows \"Yes\", know that ghost is a Nightmare!\n\nIf the 'Ghost Footsteps' value is \"No\", you must remind yourself it is an Umbra!\n\nIf 'Player Speed' value keeps decreasing whenever the ghost targets you, it is a Siren!\n\nIf 'Ghost Speed' value is inversely proportional to your energy, the ghost is a Wendigo!\n\nIf 'Ghost Speed' value increases slowly during hunts, that must be Dullahan!\n\nIf 'Ghost Speed' value increases each time it kills somebody, know what, that is an Aswang!\n\nIf 'Ghost Speed' value decreases each time it kills somebody, yeah, that is a Keres!","tags":["keyless","no key","demonology","ESP","mobile supported"],"script":"-- [UPDATED]\n-- by tranquiLo\n-- Discord : estranquilo\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/idgafbrother/ge-scripts/refs/heads/main/demonology.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"683c7a6f0b34d320e1d8c0d0","username":"estranquiLos","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/683c7a6f0b34d320e1d8c0d0-1748794013012.png","status":"offline","id":"683c7a6f0b34d320e1d8c0d0","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"verified":false,"views":13846,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/rbx-4a405de12e9812c5b154529146d0ea13-aae0365180ca.png","likeCount":4,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-05-03T19:35:36.760Z","editBy":{"_id":"683c7a6f0b34d320e1d8c0d0","username":"estranquiLos","status":"offline","id":"683c7a6f0b34d320e1d8c0d0"},"keyLink":"","executes":20498,"keyless":false,"milestones":[{"key":"script.executions","tier":10000,"value":15489,"at":"2026-09-29T05:45:00.006Z"}],"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69f7a388091211203028e0d7","editBy":{"_id":"683c7a6f0b34d320e1d8c0d0","username":"estranquiLos","status":"offline","id":"683c7a6f0b34d320e1d8c0d0"},"message":"[NEW] [NO KEY] Demonology Script","createdAt":"2026-05-03T19:35:36.769Z"},{"_id":"6a2425f9d96b1b9fccdc1749","editBy":{"_id":"683c7a6f0b34d320e1d8c0d0","username":"estranquiLos","status":"offline","id":"683c7a6f0b34d320e1d8c0d0"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2026-06-06T13:51:53.154Z"},{"_id":"6a255614d42ea6c53599aac2","editBy":{"_id":"683c7a6f0b34d320e1d8c0d0","username":"estranquiLos","status":"offline","id":"683c7a6f0b34d320e1d8c0d0"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2026-06-07T11:29: